*> vybe-test: cobol/initialize_forms/set_multiple_conditions_same_field
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_initialize_forms.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 STATUS PIC 9 VALUE 0.
    88 OPEN-STATUS VALUE 1.
    88 CLOSE-STATUS VALUE 2.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    SET OPEN-STATUS TO TRUE.
    DISPLAY STATUS.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING STATUS DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

